### Unidirectional Data Flow (UDF) Sequence Diagram

This sequence diagram illustrates the step-by-step lifecycle of an asynchronous user request in React Native.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Screen as React Native Screen
    participant Hook as Custom ViewModel Hook
    participant UseCase as GetUserProfileUseCase
    participant Repo as UserRepositoryImpl
    participant API as Fetch / Network API

    User->>Screen: Tap "Refresh Profile" Button
    Screen->>Hook: refreshProfile()
    Hook->>Hook: setUiState({ kind: 'loading' })
    Screen-->>User: Render ActivityIndicator Spinner
    Hook->>UseCase: execute(userId)
    UseCase->>Repo: getUserProfile(userId)
    Repo->>API: fetch('/v1/users/{id}')
    API-->>Repo: Return UserNetworkDto JSON
    Repo->>Repo: Map DTO to Domain Model & Memory Cache
    Repo-->>UseCase: Return UserDomainModel
    UseCase-->>Hook: Return UserDomainModel
    Hook->>Hook: setUiState({ kind: 'success', user })
    Hook-->>Screen: Re-render Functional Component
    Screen-->>User: Display Profile Details & Badges
```

